    "detailed_description": "In a ruined world, overrun by evil robots, a disabled cyborg named Blaze rests. Send a spark of energy from your world to Blaze\u2019s to wake him up. <br><br>Help Blaze take revenge against the robots in this fast paced 2D platformer where you workout to level up. The Fittest Fire game features:<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Powerful melee attacks that devastate enemies and recharge your ammo</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537510/extras/ecff5b4ccfe53042fe877e419be13615.poster.avif?t=1708746399\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537510/extras/ecff5b4ccfe53042fe877e419be13615.webm?t=1708746399\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537510/extras/ecff5b4ccfe53042fe877e419be13615.mp4?t=1708746399\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fast ranged attacks to dispatch enemies from a distance</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537510/extras/b3085fb50da7dd122450eb302bf4b684.poster.avif?t=1708746399\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537510/extras/b3085fb50da7dd122450eb302bf4b684.webm?t=1708746399\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537510/extras/b3085fb50da7dd122450eb302bf4b684.mp4?t=1708746399\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tight movement controls with variable jumping, dashing, and wall jumping</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537510/extras/169fdf037818d8d26b7edeaedaacd9fd.poster.avif?t=1708746399\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537510/extras/169fdf037818d8d26b7edeaedaacd9fd.webm?t=1708746399\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537510/extras/169fdf037818d8d26b7edeaedaacd9fd.mp4?t=1708746399\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An explorable world with 12 unique areas, 8 bosses, and 20+ enemy types</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537510/extras/7f2d95d8837a87d300064f0ebf274b25.poster.avif?t=1708746399\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537510/extras/7f2d95d8837a87d300064f0ebf274b25.webm?t=1708746399\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537510/extras/7f2d95d8837a87d300064f0ebf274b25.mp4?t=1708746399\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fittest Fire comes with a mobile app</strong></h2><br>Fittest Fire is both a game and mobile app. The Fittest Fire mobile app allows you to log exercises and get points based on the weight, reps, time, and/or distance. These points can be used in the Fittest Fire game to:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Increase sword and gun damage as well as the attack speed<br></li><li>Unlock powerful special attacks for both the sword and gun<br></li><li>Increase health points, movement speed, and power up durations</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537510/extras/b22a32e2037a7cb0268fdf39a15acc25.poster.avif?t=1708746399\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537510/extras/b22a32e2037a7cb0268fdf39a15acc25.webm?t=1708746399\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537510/extras/b22a32e2037a7cb0268fdf39a15acc25.mp4?t=1708746399\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Power up with Fire mode once it\u2019s unlocked</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537510/extras/45a108bd08578c2ad8c15cbfb1f2d07b.poster.avif?t=1708746399\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537510/extras/45a108bd08578c2ad8c15cbfb1f2d07b.webm?t=1708746399\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537510/extras/45a108bd08578c2ad8c15cbfb1f2d07b.mp4?t=1708746399\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>It's possible to play the game without downloading the mobile app. However, you will not be able to level up without the mobile app and will face significantly more difficult gameplay.",
    "about_the_game": "In a ruined world, overrun by evil robots, a disabled cyborg named Blaze rests. Send a spark of energy from your world to Blaze\u2019s to wake him up. <br><br>Help Blaze take revenge against the robots in this fast paced 2D platformer where you workout to level up. The Fittest Fire game features:<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Powerful melee attacks that devastate enemies and recharge your ammo</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537510/extras/ecff5b4ccfe53042fe877e419be13615.poster.avif?t=1708746399\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537510/extras/ecff5b4ccfe53042fe877e419be13615.webm?t=1708746399\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537510/extras/ecff5b4ccfe53042fe877e419be13615.mp4?t=1708746399\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fast ranged attacks to dispatch enemies from a distance</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537510/extras/b3085fb50da7dd122450eb302bf4b684.poster.avif?t=1708746399\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537510/extras/b3085fb50da7dd122450eb302bf4b684.webm?t=1708746399\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537510/extras/b3085fb50da7dd122450eb302bf4b684.mp4?t=1708746399\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tight movement controls with variable jumping, dashing, and wall jumping</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537510/extras/169fdf037818d8d26b7edeaedaacd9fd.poster.avif?t=1708746399\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537510/extras/169fdf037818d8d26b7edeaedaacd9fd.webm?t=1708746399\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537510/extras/169fdf037818d8d26b7edeaedaacd9fd.mp4?t=1708746399\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An explorable world with 12 unique areas, 8 bosses, and 20+ enemy types</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537510/extras/7f2d95d8837a87d300064f0ebf274b25.poster.avif?t=1708746399\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537510/extras/7f2d95d8837a87d300064f0ebf274b25.webm?t=1708746399\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537510/extras/7f2d95d8837a87d300064f0ebf274b25.mp4?t=1708746399\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fittest Fire comes with a mobile app</strong></h2><br>Fittest Fire is both a game and mobile app. The Fittest Fire mobile app allows you to log exercises and get points based on the weight, reps, time, and/or distance. These points can be used in the Fittest Fire game to:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Increase sword and gun damage as well as the attack speed<br></li><li>Unlock powerful special attacks for both the sword and gun<br></li><li>Increase health points, movement speed, and power up durations</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537510/extras/b22a32e2037a7cb0268fdf39a15acc25.poster.avif?t=1708746399\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537510/extras/b22a32e2037a7cb0268fdf39a15acc25.webm?t=1708746399\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537510/extras/b22a32e2037a7cb0268fdf39a15acc25.mp4?t=1708746399\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Power up with Fire mode once it\u2019s unlocked</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537510/extras/45a108bd08578c2ad8c15cbfb1f2d07b.poster.avif?t=1708746399\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537510/extras/45a108bd08578c2ad8c15cbfb1f2d07b.webm?t=1708746399\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537510/extras/45a108bd08578c2ad8c15cbfb1f2d07b.mp4?t=1708746399\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>It's possible to play the game without downloading the mobile app. However, you will not be able to level up without the mobile app and will face significantly more difficult gameplay.",
